'''Gate 3-C''' was a gate at the [[Daiyu spaceport|spaceport]] on [[Daiyu]]. [[Con artist]] [[Haja Estree]], who masqueraded as a [[Jedi]], helped [[Corran]] and his [[Parent|mother]],<ref name="Part II" /> [[Nyche]],<ref name="CGttSWG">''[[Star Wars Encyclopedia: The Comprehensive Guide to the Star Wars Galaxy]]''</ref> escape Daiyu through his contact in Gate 3-C.<ref name="Part II" />

